{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KmT06NEPJ71793338185.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股在10月最後一個交易日，一度升逾400點。</p><p></p><p>科網股支撐大市，阿里巴巴及騰訊升百分之2，小米及美團更升百分之4。</p><p></p><p>友邦新業務價值倒退，但大行看好本季表現，股價升百分之3。</p><p></p><p>內需股也有追捧，蒙牛急升百分之7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:33.562433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.656873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:52.545396+00:00","content_hash":"ff980a59a78449eef9662b4e2fc8395e41e91ba46f2c62e2aa79ea0114cd286c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:33.562433+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}